<&| /page/info_section.mas, 
   title      => "步驟 2：性狀清單(Step 2: Traits list)",
  collapsible => 1,
  collapsed   => 1
&>

性狀清單檔案需要為純文字檔案，且應如下所示格式(The traits list file needs to be in a text file and should look like the following format)。<br/>

<pre>
  traits             definition                            unit
  fruit perimeter    the maximum perimeter of the fruit    cm
  fruit area         total area of the fruit               sq. cm
  fruit weight
</pre>


定義與單位為選填，但能讓資料庫使用者獲得更多關於表型資料的資訊(The definition and unit are optional but would make the phenotype data more informative to users of the database)。<br/>

強烈建議使用茄科表型本體 (Solanaceae Phenotype Ontology) 以進行跨研究的比較分析，但非強制要求(Use of the Solanaceae Phenotype Ontology is highly encouraged to allow cross-study comparative analysis but not required)。<br/>  
</&>
